This product includes role prompts and team culture adapted from OpenRig
(https://github.com/mvschwarz/openrig), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The adaptation replaces OpenRig's coordination commands with bb's.

The design review lenses (designReviewPrompt in roles.ts) and the way findings
are resolved and rounds end are adapted from the Elephant & Goldfish Model
(https://github.com/google/elephant-goldfish-model), Copyright Google LLC,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The adaptation keeps EGM's
review mode only and replaces its orchestration with the factory's commands.

The UI components in components/, hooks/ and lib/ come from the bb plugin
registry (https://github.com/get-bb/bb), built on shadcn/ui
(https://ui.shadcn.com), both under the MIT License.

The factory icon (assets/factory.svg) is from Lucide (https://lucide.dev),
licensed under the ISC License.
